const services=[['weekly-pool-service','Weekly pool service','A clean pool. A clear routine.','Spend your weekends in the water, not working on it. Choose the level of weekly cleaning and water balancing that fits your pool.',['Water testing and chemical balancing','Basket and debris removal with full care','Wall brushing and equipment checks','Care options matched to your pool']],['green-to-clean','Green-to-clean recovery','Get your backyard back.','Cloudy water and algae can take over quickly. Pappas Pools assesses the water and filtration system, then develops a recovery plan for your pool.',['Assess water condition and filtration','Treat algae and rebalance the water','Remove accumulated debris','Plan ongoing care to help prevent a repeat']],['equipment-repair','Pool equipment repair','Solve the problem behind the symptom.','A noisy pump, weak circulation, or heater that will not start can put your pool on pause. Request a diagnosis and discuss repair options before work begins.',['Pump repair and replacement','Filter cleaning and repair','Heater troubleshooting','Pool plumbing and drain concerns']],['spa-service','Spa & hot tub care','More soaking. Less second-guessing.','Keep your spa care on a reliable routine with cleaning, water balancing, and help with equipment concerns.',['Weekly spa maintenance','Water chemistry and cleaning','Equipment troubleshooting','Discuss draining and refill needs']],['new-pool-startups','New pool startups','A fresh start for your pool.','Get help establishing a care routine for your new pool. Discuss water balancing, equipment, and startup needs with Pappas Pools.',['Discuss your pool finish and startup requirements','Review water chemistry','Check filtration and circulation','Plan ongoing maintenance']]];
