const faq=[['What does weekly pool care include?','Weekly maintenance can include balancing, baskets, brushing, debris removal, vacuuming, and equipment checks. Confirm your exact scope in your quote.'],['How much does pool service cost?','Your quote depends on your pool, its condition, equipment, and chosen service level. Ask for a written scope and price before starting.'],['Can you help with a green or cloudy pool?','Yes. Request green-to-clean service so Pappas Pools can assess water condition, filtration, and the treatment needed. Recovery time varies by pool.'],['Do you service saltwater pools and spas?','Pappas Pools describes experience with different pool systems, including saltwater, and offers spa service. Include your system type when requesting a quote.'],['Do I have to be home?','Discuss access and scheduling when your service is confirmed. If you have pets, locked gates, or access restrictions, include those details when arranging your first visit.'],['Do you serve my neighborhood?','Pappas Pools is based in Orangevale and serves the greater Sacramento area. Submit your ZIP code to confirm route availability.']];
